<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">2PE 2PE 2PE - Lamma</book>
  <para style="h">2 Bituru</para>
  <para style="toc1">Sẽkoo gbete Bituru pɛsi beenɛyɛ 2 Bituru,</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Bitru</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 P</para>
  <para style="mt2">Sẽkoo e ziti au shɛ a</para>
  <para style="mt1">BITURU NAA</para>
  <para style="imt">Yutasinɛ,</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Sẽkoo a ziti au shɛ a Bituru naa</char> shɔ beeri shɔ Kirisa ai si a ɗekɨnye yɛne ɗɔɔ ai si ɗɔnyɛ piti kpai. U yuu yɔrinɛ basi aru shomala nyayelinɛmiyi vimatinɛ.Vi a shɔ kasi a ɗɔmyɛ shɔu ã sisɨn a ka Ɗalapa zɛnɛ a Uɓeyelapa Yɛsɔ krisi, vizɛnɛ gbete shɔ nta a shɔmiyi nyaye sipɛ vimatinɛ a Yɛsɔ matiyiyɛ au ɓɛbi. Shɔ vi beenɛu pɔ̃ yuuba a shɔgbeteyi mati shɔ vinɛ Kirisi yɛ sɔtɔɓayɛyi yuu. Bituru shalinɛ vi au zãri Krisi sɔnɛ shẽtiyɛ jo ruu Ɗalapa &lt;&lt;ji kasiɓa nɛ shɔwɔ u kpa lɛsitɔ ɓa ama kasinɛ kopiya u yau ruuvini pɛlinɛto &gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="iot">Vi au ɓuzɨn yɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">Yutasinɛ(1.1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛyi nya ɓnɛ (1.3-22)</para>
  <para style="io1">Shɔmala nyazɔ̃yi (2.1-22)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kirisi ɓɛɛ anɛ dangdang (3.1-18)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Sekoom shɛ ang naa nkɔng Siman Bituru, Yesɔ Kirisi jawɛrɛ au jashonɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 1:1">Yɛnɛ shɔgbete i tɛ sisɨn ãnɛtɛ naa u tɛ siyɛ sisɨn gbete, ɔ tɛrɛ aru u Ɗalapa a shɔshɔraanɛ Yesɔ Kirisini i pɛli vitɔ̃vɨng tɛpɛ-tɛpɛː <verse eid="2PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Mɛnɛ tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ a ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛ u ɔ̃ ɔ ɓɛɛ ɗɔrɔrɔ aka Ɗalapa zɛnɛ a Yesɔ Uɓeyelapa.<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗalapa Lɔɔnɛ a Nya Ɓaanɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Ɗalapa au tete kaka bi ãu vigbetete u kãyɛtɛ piti au yɛ tesi shɔ ɗekɨn au nyaba gɨnnɛ, u kpaa vim zɛnɛ aru u zɛ Ɗalapa au lɔuyɛ tɛttɔ, lɔurɛ aru u bassiutɔ a tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Ji nyabankɔ tasiu u ruu pɛ̃niba au ma a ukɔunitɛ, pɛli nankɔ aru u kpaa jo au tete vipɛlinɛni, aru u kpaa naranɛ atette ruuvini kotipi, au kpaa a nyaba gbɔgbɔ pɛlinɛyɛ. <verse eid="2PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Aru nankɔ aru ɔ ã sisɨn a Kirirsi bi ɔ ma sisɨn ɔ pɛli vitɔ̃vɨng awɔ sisɨn ãnɛni, awɔ vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ ɔ ɔ̃ a vizɛnɛni; awɔ vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ ɔ yɛ kpaa vizɛnɛtɔ. <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />Awɔ vizɛnɛ Ɗalapa ɔ ɔ̃ shɔ yuu sãnɛ; awɔ yuu sãnɛ ɔ ɔ̃ a sisɨnmɛɛnɛni; awɔ sisɨnmɛɛni ɔ kã ɔ̃nɛ Ɗalapa; <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />awɔ ɔ̃nɛ Ɗalapa ɔ ɔri zɔtɔ; ɔ ɔri kopiyatɔ. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Shom ji vitɔ̃vɨng awɔ yɛ pɛliyɛkɔ, ɔkɛ ɔ̃nɛ awuni fɛ̃ɛm yɛ pɔ̃wɔrɛ ɔ vishonɛ yɛ ɔ̃ tɔ̃vɨn a nyaba vizɛnɛ a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi ruubiini. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Ama ɔ ji ɔ̃ ɓa awuni ɓa, ɔ naa shɔgbete ai zɛ ɗɔ ɓayɛ, aru i nɔɔgbãti, i suki tɛttɔ nɛ shɔ sɔɔkiyi ruuvini ai pɛli a kɨntitɛ.<verse eid="2PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Aru nankɔ masayi, ɔ mabiitɔ fɛ̃ɛm ɔ tasirɛ nɛ Ɗalapa lɔwɔ nɛn raawɔtɔ. Ɔ mabiitɔ fɛ̃ɛm u tasinɛ ukɔ lɔwɔrɛ, ɔkɛ pɛlinɛ ɔ yaawɔɔ sisɨn ãnɛ ɓa. <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />A nyabankɔ Ɗalapa yɛ tɛwɔ naatɔ a lakpati gaanɛ au sɔ̃nyaɓayɛ dangdang. Pɛ Uɓeyelapa Shɔ-shɔraanɛ Yesɔ Kirisi lakpati. <verse eid="2PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Kopiɗaviya n yɛn kpaarɔɔ sisɨntɔ a ruu vimiyini, ruu tɔ̃vɨn awɔ tɛ miyi ɔ kpaau gɨn-gɨn tɛttɔ fɛ̃ɛm ko ɔ zɛtɛ n yɛn kpaarɔɔ sisɨn tɔ a vimni. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Ang zɛnɛ pɛ tɔ̃vɨn n yɛn yɛɗekn awɔ sisɨn kpaarinɛnitɔ, n kɛ ɔ̃nɛ a suruni. <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />N zɛ tɛtɔ n yɛ ɔ̃ ɓa dɔkɔkɔ ɓa n yɛn vɔtɔ, nagbete Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi gelinyɛ wasa-wasa. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />N yɛn mabiitɔ n kã nyaba ang kpaarɔɔ sisɨn ang knti vɔnɛ ayuu ruumiyini kopiɗaviya.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔgbete i Zɛ Kirisi Basinɛyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />A ɗagbete u gelɔɔ nɔgbete Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi ruu gbete yɛ a yɛ a kakani, ɓanɛ u sha ruuɓere a viu geliyɛni ɓa, u zɛu bassinɛ ji au nɔɔ. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />U si ji ɗɔukɔ aɗagbete Ɗalapa Da ãu banɛ a bassinɛni, Ɗalapa yeenya e bassinɛ pɛ̃niba, &lt;&lt;Shɔm pɛ n jaa ɔrinɛ, bitɔ̃nyatɔ awuni waanɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />U au yuu u nta yeenya shɛ a kolapa, aɗagbete u si awuni a kɔpɔ au wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ.<verse eid="2PE 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />U ã sisɨntɛ fɛ̃ɛm a ruu gbete janyagadi i nwayɛni. Yɛ ɔ̃rɔɔ vitɔ̃vɨng ɔkɛ weshonɛtɔ ɗɔn, aru i nyanwanɛ pɛ naa yaa sẽwa au kɔli a ɗɔkɨnri, ɔ yaatɔ kɔlinɛ sẽwa nogadi u ɓɛsɔɔwɔ yaa a sisɨn. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Ayuu vimiyi piti kpai, ɔ kpaa sisɨntɔ shɔwɔ yɛ zɛnɔɔ dɔɔɓa u tadɔɔ laabeenɛ Ɗanyaruubii a janyagadi shayɛ a ɗekɨn ɓa. <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />Aru Ɗanyaruubii gbete janyagadiyi nwayɛ u gɨnri ji shɛɓa a shɔzɛ naa leegbeteɓa, ama shɔzɛ isi jo a Suru Wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ nakɔ aɗagbete ikɛ nwa Ɗa nyaruubii gbete shɛ a Ɗalapa nyayɛnɛ.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s1">Shɔmala Nyayeenɛyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Ama si tɛ̃ɛtɛ̃ɛ shɔmala nyazɔ̃yi shɛtɔ a shɔ tetteni, ji nagbete shɔmala nyazɔ̃ i yɛ ɔ̃tɔ awɔ teteniyɛ. I yɛ matishɔvi nyazɔ̃ a Ɗalapa yuu, ama atette ɓusinɛ i yɛ n ti shɔ vimatinɛ au yɛ lɛsi shɔ yɛ. I yɛ bẽẽ Uɓeyelapa a shɔwɛrɛ shɔgbete vɔ ai yuu ruuvini yɛtɔ. Aru nankɔ i yɛ ɔ̃ ɓa ɗɔkɔkɔ ɓa i yɛ lɛsi i yuutɔ. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Shɔzɛ waanɛ i yɛ gɨn i vipɛlinɛ ruuvintɔ, shɔmiyi i yɛ pɛli jo vikɔ̃linɛ shɔmala nyayeenɛ i pɛliyɛkɔ. i yɛ pɔ̃rɛ shɔu lɛri kɔ̃linɛ ayuu nyaba tɔ̃vɨn. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Shɔmala nyayeenɛ i yɛ ɗakiwɔrɛ i gelɔɔ ruu nyayeenɛ i tɛ virɛ awɔ naa. Ama si ji tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ̃ shɔ yeeruu tɛttɔ ai yuuni, shɔu yɛ lɛsiyɛ u ɗɔgbete gai yɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Ko Ɗajashonɛlapayi gbete i pɛli ruuvini Ɗalapa ji yaaiɓa lokiyi a wɛrɛ yaa, shɔ mayi dɔɔ a saagãnya a ɗɔkɨnri, i ɗɔgbete i ga dii gbete shɔ yeeruuyɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />A ɗagbete si tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ̃yɛ Ɗalapa ji yaasi shɔgbete i gɨn Ɗalapa ɓa a kotipi ruuvini ɓa, n-tiu mii kolapa ai yuu; ama raa jo Nuhu kɔ sheeli, au nwari shɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨnyɛ a shɔwɔyini manzii. <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />Ɗalapa lɛsi tipi Sɔdom a Gumora ni a toi a yaa, a sɨnrɛ i ɔ̃ vitasinɛ vigbete yɛ kpaa shɔgbete i sisɨn Ɗa gɨnnɛ ɓayɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />Ɗalapa raa Loti, aru u sipɛ shɔ tɔ̃vɨn, loti yɔriyuutɔ fɛ̃ɛm aru vikɔ̃linɛ a shɔyi gɨn Ɗalapa nyaãsinɛ ɓa i pɛliyɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />Loti shɔ tɔ̃vɨn ama ɔ̃ atette shɔ kɔ̃linɛyi, ɓooraatɔ aɗɔ sɨnɛ a lee-lee aɗagbete zɛyi vikɔ̃linɛ ai shoyɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />Ama Uɓeyelapa zɛ nɔgbete yɛ raa shɔgbete i gɨn Ɗalapa yɛ tɛttɔ ai tete sisɨn ntanɛni, zɛ nɔgbete yɛ gɨn a shɔ kɔ̃linɛni yɛnɛ lee ruuyeenɛ, <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />Badijo shɔgbete i gɨn vi kasinɛ au shɛ nyaba ruuvini, i kasi ɓa nɛi ɔ̃ Ɗalapa nosisɨn ɓa, shɔmala nyayeenɛyi yuse ɓa, i yuɗenɛ aɗɔn, ama i bassi Ɗalapa vipɛlinɛ kolapa ɓa, i dãyi sɔ̃ntɔ. <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />Ko Ɗajashonɛlapayi ai yuu, shɔgbete i pɛ̃niba i tɛ shɔmala nyayeenɛyi tɛ fɛ̃ɛm, i jo dãyi ɓa a Uɓeyelapa ɗekɨn ni ɓa. <verse eid="2PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Ama shɔmiyi i shali vikɔ̃linɛ ayuu vigbete i jo zɛ ɓayɛ, i naa viɓiliyi ai lɛri ɓayɛ, ama i pɛli ɓɛɛ jo vigbete i kasi pɛlinɛyɛ, Ɗalapa yɛ lɛsiyitɔ naa viɓiliyi, i yɛ vɔtɔ. <verse eid="2PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />Ɗalapa yɛ kɔsiyi nɔɔ jo zali a ruuvini gbete i pɛliyɛkɔ, shɔmala nyayeenɛyi i kasi ɓɛɛ jo vikɔ̃linɛ ɓoolinɛ a sɔrɔ pɛlinɛ a niti, gbete i yɛ nta tɔ̃vɨn a jazɛbiiyɛ, i naa vizizi au ɗii a fãrã puruyɛ, i ntayi tɔ̃vɨntɔ a ɗɔyi kɛ pɛli ruuvini nɛ au teteyɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />kopiɗaviya i kã ɓɛɛ jo su gbete i yɛ pɛli kpãntang ayiniyɛ; i yɔ ɓa a ruuvini pɛlinɛni ɓa. I ɗaki shɔgbete i sisɨn ãnɛni ji laki ɓa. I zɛnɔɔ vi kãnɛtɛ a shɔ naani. aru i vishonɛ i pɛli nankɔ Ɗalapa wiriyitɛ! <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />I yaa vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛtɛ, i gɨn nyaba Balam, Beyo ɓɛɛ jaa, shɔu kasi nɛn kpaa nazã a vikɔ̃linɛ au pɛliyɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />Ama shɔ zãriu nyanwatɔ a ruuvini au pɛliyɛnɛ, u gãtola nwanya a shɔzɛ yeenya a zãri janyagadim u vishonɛ kɔ̃linɛ pɛlinɛrɛ.<verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Sɔmiyi naa jaaɓootiyi gbete mii ɓa ɗɔn ɓayɛ, i naa sabu gbete sɔrɔ n-tiyɛ. Aru gbetenkɔ Ɗalapa pɔ̃siyi ɗɔ ɔ̃nɛtɛ a ɗɔkɨnri gbikiri-gbikiri. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Shɔmiyi i basi yuu fɛ̃ɛm, i nwanya kɔ̃linɛyi fɛ̃ɛm, i kãnɛ shɔgbete i yaa ruuvini pɛlinɛ dootɔ sɔrinɛ a ruuvini. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />I ma a shɔni nɛyiyɛyi kpaa ɔ̃nɛ yuutɔ, ama i ai yuu i pɛ foo a ruuvini pɛlinɛni. Aruviya shɔzɛ upɛ fooyi a vigbete sã yuuyɛni kpai. <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Naa i ranaanɛ a ruuvini kotipi aru u zɛ Uɓeyelapa a shɔshɔraanɛ Yesɔ Kirisi nii, ama ikɛ sɔɔsɔ̃nɛ i ɗɔ ruuvini pɛlinɛ, shɔmiyi i lɛsinɛ tɛɛ gbete si kɨntitɔ. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Si ɔ̃riyi ntɔ a gbete isi jo zɛ tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ ɓayɛ a kang gbete i zɛyɛni. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Vigbete kpaiyiyɛ tasinɛ ruɓusinɛ pɛ nizɛ: &lt;&lt;Zaa sɔɔ ɗɔ viu geyɛ ɗɛɛtinɛtɔ&gt;&gt; a &lt;&lt;Gãnya gbete shɔ sɔkiyɛ sɔɔtɛ yɛtɛ boliki bitɛ a tɔ̃pɔ̃.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ruumanɛ a Uɓeyelapa Anɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />N shɔ ɔrinɛ masayi, shom pɛ n sẽkoo ang pɛsɔɔ beerinɛ. A yɛti sẽkoo ziti piti n beerɛ n kpaarɔɔ sisɨn, n kasirɛ n masɔɔbii ɔ lɛritɔ a nyaba tɔ̃vɨn. <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />N kasirɛ ɔ kpaa sisɨntɔ aru vigbete janyagadi wɔsɔ-wɔsɔyi nwarɔɔ si tɛ̃ɛ-tɛ̃ɛyɛ, ɔ kpaa sisɨntɔ a nyaãsinɛ gbete Uɓeyelapa a shɔ-shɔraanɛ gelɔɔ au jashonɛyi nyayɛ. <verse eid="2PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />A vi piti, nkɔ vigbete ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ ɔ zɛtɔ yɛm, a leegbete koyisinyayɛ shɔnyaãnɛ i yɛ atɔ, i ntalɔɔnya, i latiwɔrɛ i gɨn ɓɛɛ jo i vikɔ̃linɛ ai kasiyɛ. <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />I yɛ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Yesɔ ji gelɔɔ ɓa nɛn yɛ sɔɔtɔ ɓaya? Ukɛ piya? U ɓɛuruyi vɔ dijo tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ̃, ama vi doodijjo nagbete si jo a ɗagbete koo shɛyɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />I bɛ̃ɛ̃ kasinɛ ji ai zɛnɛ nɛ Ɗalapa kɔ ãsinyarɛ koo shɛkɛkɨn, u nya shanɛkɔ vɔsi kotipirɛ a miini ama mii kɨntiurɛ atette, <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />si sɔ̃njo a miikɔ, Ɗalapa lɛsi koo gbete a kntirɛ, mii kolapa ukɔ lɛsi koorɛ. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Ama kolapa a kotipim Ɗalapa nyaãsinɛkɔ sãyirɛ, nogbete shɔyɛ lɛsi a yaa. Shɔ yaayi pɛtɔ se leeu shɔyɛ yeeri shɔyi gɨn Ɗalapa ɓayɛ ruu, shɔ yɛ lɛsiyi kɛkn. <verse eid="2PE 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Ama n shɔ ɔrinɛ, masayi, ɔkɔɔ suki vi gbete n yɛn gelɔɔ yɛnɛ. A Uɓeyelapa kabii lee gbete a saa laazɔrɔ waanɛ u vɔsinɛ ɓa; saa laazɔrɔ naa lee gbete au biini. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Ɗalapa vɔsibii ɓa a viu manɛn pɛliyɛni ɓa, nagbete shɔwɔyi ji zɛ ɓayɛ, ama u sisɨnmɛɛnɛ aɗɔn aruviya ji kasi ɓanɛ shɔwɔ u lɛsirɛ ɓa, kasinɛ kopiya u yaa ruuvini pɛlinɛtɔ.<verse eid="2PE 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Ama Uɓeyelapa u lee anɛ yɛ ɔ̃ naa ɓɔɔ. A leeukɔ kolapa yɛ kaa nyaa a gãgãni u nirɛ, vi kolapa kpai shɔ yɛ lɛsitɔ a yaa, vigbete a kotipi kpai i yɛ niitɔ. <verse eid="2PE 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Ɔ zɛtɛ shɔyɛ lɛsi vitɔ piti kap, ɔ yɛ ɔ̃kɛpi zɔng shɔzɛ ɗɔpiya? Ɔ ɔ̃nɛ u ɔ̃ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ ɔ ɔ̃ shɔ Ɗalapa bassinɛ a sisɨn gbete, <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />Naa ɔ ɗɔgbete ɔ ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ leegbete Ɗalapa yɛ a yɛ, ɔ pɛli vitɔ̃vɨng aru leeu u a nagbete, a leeukɔ yaa yɛ lɛsi kolapa rɛ, yaa shɛ̃shɛ̃ yɛ kã vi ai a kolapatɔ. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Ama u ga pɛ vigbete Ɗalapa mayɛ: kolapa sɔɔ a kotipini, shɔ Ɗalapa gɨnnɛ ai pɛli vitɔvɨng yɛ ikɔyi yɛ ɔ̃rɛ a ɗɔnni.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Aru nankɔ masayi, naa ɔkɛ ɔ̃nɛ, ɔ̃nɛ kolapa sɔɔ ganɛ ɔ mabiitɔ ɔ pɛli vitɔ̃vɨng ɔ ɔ̃ ɓa shɔ ruuvini a Ɗalapa ɗɔbi ni ɓa. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />U zɛ Uɓeyelapa sisɨnmɛɛnɛm, u ɔ̃riukɛ nyaba au ãunɛ u kpaa naraanɛyɛ, ji nagbete u ɓesa ɔrinɛ Bulus, beerɔɔ yɛ, pɛli vishonɛ a sẽrẽ gbete Ɗalapa ãuyɛ. <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />Bulus bee jo nankɔ au sẽkooni piti, nwanya jo ayuu vigbeten gelɔɔnkɔ. U sẽkoou kpetekpete shɔ zɛ ɓa pɛlaani ɓa, Shɔgbete ai vizɛnɛ ɓa bang ɓa i rii dɔɔruutanɛtɔ, nagbete i pɛli a gãsi laabeenɛ Ɗanyaruubiini yɛ. Aruukɔ i n-tiyi yuu lɛsinɛrɛ.<verse eid="2PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Aru nankɔ masa gbete n ɔriyiyɛ, ɔ zɛvimiyi tɛttɔ gboti, ɔ shidɔɔkaziti aru shɔgbete i gɨnnɛ Ɗa ɓa nyaba tɔ̃vɨn ɓa i yɛ ɗakiwɔrɛ ɔ yaa nyaba tɔ̃vɨn rɛ. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Ama ɔ yɛ ɗekɨn a vizɛnɛ a tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ au Uɓeyelapa a shɔ-shɔ raanɛ Yesɔ Kirisi vishonɛni. Bassinɛ pɛu ɓɛɛkɔ dɔdɔrim yɛnɛ ɗekɨn dangdang! Nankɔ.<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>